Upstream sources this tree derives from, cited rather than vendored.

- https://github.com/2genkidev/buusfury, a disassembly of Dragon Ball Z: Buu's
  Fury. The revision cc53d0cd2d1c167e749419187e2d92017ac07468 is the base of
  tools/gate/gate.py, tools/lint/lints.py, tools/check_links.py,
  tools/testkit.py, tools/incbin.bat, tools/extract/slice_rom.py, scatter.ld,
  rebuild.cmd and extract.cmd.
- The Webfoot container codec and the JCALG1 body decoder in tools/compress/ are
  carried from the Buu's Fury reconstruction tree cited above. That codec's bit
  grammar is promoted from spicybung/DragonByteZ (MIT).
- jcalg1 by Jeremy Collake, https://github.com/jeremycollake/jcalg1, MIT licence,
  copyright (c) 2020 Jeremy Collake. This tree carries only the compiled
  tools/compress/compress.exe built from it and cites the upstream licence
  rather than vendoring its source.
- grit by Dylan Graham, https://github.com/DylanGraham/grit. Referenced by the
  asset pipeline this tree is being built for; not distributed here.

No game image is distributed in this repository. The builder supplies the retail
ROM. This project is not affiliated with the rights holders of the game.
